Revision 24-03-2025
- small revision based on the input of the internal control group

Revision 17-03-2025
- harmonize the explanation on the RINF parameters as documents
- remove any unnecessary dcterms:description annotations.
- overall review of general explanations, examples, following the input of ERA TSI experts

Revision 11-03-2025: annotations harmonization
- Removed dcterms:source duplicates with same URI different by https
- Reused rdfs:seeAlso instead of dcterms:source pointing to URLs different from ELI URI legal reference
- Simple editorial changes based on orthography review
- Add missing levels in the parameters hierarchy and link them to properties representing RINF parameters
- Reintroduction of rinfINndex annotations to the hierarchical properties

Revision 10-03-2025
- Changed the axiom for the era:SubsidiaryLocation
- Fixes on the relations between kilometric posts and the linear positioning system
- Property era:inCountry can be part of a subset with common characteristics
- Property era:infrastructureManager was missing the domain of infrastructure elements
- Addition of the era:connectedTo property to address a simple connectivity between tracks, as RINF parameter 'internal connectivity'.
- Adding missing domains on the properties for the RINF parameters 1.1.1.5.x
- Adding missing domains on the era:notApplicable and era:notYetAvailable property flags
- Adding axioms on the NetRelation to ensure that all properties are provided
- Removed duplicate values for era:applicable

